{"id":"u08fbbt4q19izrbt0eagteerj","title":"气体同位素质谱分析中的静态模式与动态模式","originalTitle":"气体同位素分析：静态真空与动态真空有何不同？","summary":"气体同位素质谱分析中，静态模式通过高真空环境测量固定样品，适合微量稀有气体分析；动态模式则通过持续抽气维持工作压力，适用于稳定同位素的连续传输与比较。两种模式的选择取决于气体性质、样品量和分析目标。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3549522&do=blog&id=1560898"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T05:59:47.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.246Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T11:58:21.246Z","category":"ai-frontier","tags":["论文发表"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"f70a93af-7d43-4934-b875-ef7ad38481d2","title":"气体同位素质谱分析中静态与动态模式的应用差异"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"f70a93af-7d43-4934-b875-ef7ad38481d2","title":"气体同位素质谱分析中静态与动态模式的应用差异"}],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fISWT1Hc5xiA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}